claude-docker builds a container image that installs and runs third-party
software which is downloaded at build or run time and remains under its own
license. Notable components include Anthropic's Claude Code and the CLIs
gh, glab, aws-cli, openspec, uv, pnpm, tfenv, and git-lfs. Anthropic, Claude,
and Claude Code are trademarks of Anthropic, PBC; this project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.
